WEBVTT

00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:05.004
Meet your physical world.
A populated workspace. No account or hardware needed.

00:00:05.004 --> 00:00:08.608
Every sensor, in context.
Explore six sample sensors across three spaces.

00:00:08.608 --> 00:00:15.902
See the readings behind a signal.
Open a sensor to explore its simulated history.

00:00:15.902 --> 00:00:25.053
Ask a question. Get context.
Fizz replies using the sample readings on screen.

00:00:25.053 --> 00:00:32.221
Set a threshold in seconds.
Watch the cold room above 7 °C, with a phone call preview.

00:00:32.221 --> 00:00:39.810
Catch the change as it happens.
A sample spike crosses the limit and triggers the alert.

00:00:39.810 --> 00:00:48.601
Reach the right person.
Preview the phone alert. No real call is placed in this demo.

00:00:48.601 --> 00:00:54.187
Back inside the limit.
Resolve the spike and watch the workspace return to all clear.

00:00:54.187 --> 00:00:59.762
Your world has a sidekick.
Try it yourself at fizzlayer.com/demo.html
